OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,ACourts backlog will fall despite
OL,4,Ascrapping of jury trial plan, minister
OL,5,Asays
OL,6,
OL,7,FPrime Minister Andy Burnham's decision
OL,8,Fabandons proposals introduced by Sir
OL,9,FKeir Starmer's government to allow
OL,10,Fjudges in England and Wales to make the
OL,11,Fsole decision on cases that would lead
OL,12,Fto a sentence of less than three years.
OL,14,FThe Ministry of Justice (MoJ) said only
OL,15,Fcomplex fraud and financial offences
OL,16,Fwould be judge-only - and it proposes
OL,17,Fthousands of medium-level crimes should
OL,18,Fstay with volunteer magistrates, who
OL,19,Fsit without a jury.
OL,23,APub: 04-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG4/39
