OL,3,AGreen Party members back 'Zionism is
OL,4,Aracism' motion
OL,5,
OL,6,FThey also voted to commit the party to
OL,7,Fsupporting a "single democratic
OL,8,FPalestinian State", after they rejected
OL,9,Fan amendment that had been backed by
OL,10,Fparty leader Zack Polanski.
OL,23,APub: 04-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG8/39
