OL,3,AYemen announces military campaign to
OL,4,Areclaim land from Iran-backed Houthis
OL,5,
OL,6,FYemen's Saudi-backed government has
OL,7,Fannounced a major military operation to
OL,8,Fretake territory from the Iran-backed
OL,9,FHouthis.
OL,11,FIt comes after an exchange of strikes
OL,12,Fbetween the Houthis and the Saudi-led
OL,13,Fcoalition in recent days. On Sunday,
OL,14,Fthe Houthis said they had struck sites
OL,15,Fbelonging to Saudi national oil company
OL,16,FAramco.
OL,18,FThe group said the attack was in
OL,19,Fresponse to what it described as 50
OL,20,FSaudi-led coalition air and missile
OL,21,Fstrikes in Yemen in 12 hours. Saudi
OL,22,FArabia has yet to comment.
OL,23,APub: 04-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG9/39
