OL,3,AYemen announces military campaign to
OL,4,Areclaim land from Iran-backed Houthis
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe conflict escalated in September,
OL,7,Fwhen the Houthis seized the country's
OL,8,Fentire Red Sea coast, including the
OL,9,Fvital shipping lane of the Bab
OL,10,Fal-Mandab Strait, further disrupting
OL,11,Fglobal oil supplies.
OL,23,APub: 04-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/39
